OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 25 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Erland Cooper's Cities
OL,5,     Fof the Imagination
OL,6,     GComposer Erland Cooper discovers
OL,7,     Gthe mythical city of Ker-Is,
OL,8,     GBrittany's sunken city of excess,
OL,9,     Gwhere ancient flood myths meet
OL,10,     Gmodern climate reality and Celtic
OL,11,     Glegend.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GPianist Neil Cowley is back to
OL,20,     Greveal his third Flowers pick,
OL,21,     Gand Jamie Cullum has more of his
OL,22,     Gfavourite jazz releases to share.
